{"id":"c1f1801e6d90889c","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Ring Of Sets","display":"df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets — ZFC Measure4 Ring Of Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets — ZFC Measure4 Ring Of Sets","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets — ZFC Measure4 Ring Of Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal R \\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal R \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RingOfSets}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RingOfSets}_S\\)</span> is the two-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}ring\\text{-}of\\text{-}sets} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal R\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land \\varnothing\\in\\mathcal R\\land \\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal R\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal R\\land A\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}ring\\text{-}of\\text{-}sets} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal R\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land \\varnothing\\in\\mathcal R\\land \\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal R\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal R\\land A\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里的“环”是集合环，而非带乘法的代数环：它对有限并与相对差封闭。</li>\n<li>由这些公理还可推出对有限交与对称差封闭。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal R \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RingOfSets}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}ring\\text{-}of\\text{-}sets} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal R\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land \\varnothing\\in\\mathcal R\\land \\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal R\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal R\\land A\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal R)","display":true}],"bytes":918,"backlinks":[{"id":"d5f69ca74e2bbfd2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RingOfSets}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2601","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets.md|58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}